<title>UK: BSkyB interested in taking Premiere stake.</title>
<headline>BSkyB interested in taking Premiere stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BSkyB remains interested in taking a stake in Premiere, the German pay-television service owned by Bertelsmann, Canal Plus and Kirch Group.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes, I think we probably would,&quot; BSkyB deputy managing director David Chance said when asked if the company would like to take a stake in Premiere.</p>
</text>
